gihFp2hmCIa0M1hfUYh2nkyDUzVfLz74L4-anRTRnm7iUmVfU4n2M4-DLmrFnNQ7U4CsUzVFL4vbnSb/v2veo4OeqtnjCsAbgDTJQty0LzG4okyPMmGbMkbw62T8c&oid=1201705132&tid=1038&nid=16094&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6ACFD6A1A113320D9CF15B1AC4F72625/FFDC67A1/379E\" vheight=\"222\" vwidth=\"554\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AU8Q1RM4CYLN-YUm8rkUzVfUmQfLR9NPnln7nm-ZL77YM470gihFp2hmCIa0M1hfUYh2nkyDUzVfLz74L4-anRTRnm7iUmVfU4n2M4-DLmrFnNQ7U4CsUzVFL4vbnSb/v2veo4OeqtnjCsAbgDTJQty0LzG4okyPMmGbMkbw62T8c&oid=1201705132&tid=1038&nid=16094&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p>5、打印注意事项</p><p>A4，彩色，正反打印，打印前需检查所有字段是否填写完成，是否正确，无字符超出表格。</p><p>：2026届本科毕业生<a></a>生源信息核验流程</p><p>1、 扫码或搜索“中北就创“微信公众号</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AoRU1YMRUsollYLmNl4U8rRMlUaLmlNbU8lsLRM7MzVVnNC0gihFp2hmCIa0okh7USyYM1yYUz-PLzAVo7MfnlMVU8VVLz9PUlLbLzrRoz6FMNVVMNCaUzrFoRCZnSbaptveo4OeqtnjCsAbgDTJQty0LzG4okyPMmGbMkbw62T8c&oid=1201705132&tid=1038&nid=16094&e=.png\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8DA262A2118E8CAECECAE181AC915C97/6AE6F0A5/868E\" vheight=\"259\" vwidth=\"259\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AoRU1YMRUsollYLmNl4U8rRMlUaLmlNbU8lsLRM7MzVVnNC0gihFp2hmCIa0okh7USyYM1yYUz-PLzAVo7MfnlMVU8VVLz9PUlLbLzrRoz6FMNVVMNCaUzrFoRCZnSbaptveo4OeqtnjCsAbgDTJQty0LzG4okyPMmGbMkbw62T8c&oid=1201705132&tid=1038&nid=16094&e=.png\"></p><p>2、 单击微首页-学生入口，打开此页面，登陆（初始账号为学号，密码为身份证后六位，首次登录需要修改密码）。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AL461VUmTRL4fRnmRlZU4fVUNQ2L7UNaoRGbL4Wko7MknN-0gihFp2hmCIa0L1h2MkyZU1hRol7ZnlCZUzUinzQkn7VkL8W7MmVRUN-PLzWFL8LsozNPL8WFLzCYLYb/v2veo4OeqtnjCsAbgDTJQty0LzG4okyPMmGbMkbw62T8c&oid=1201705132&tid=1038&nid=16094&e=.jpg\" hspace=\"12\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2F48BC9A8EF8A45E6BDAB3BD61CBB112/3C79913B/1623\" vheight=\"376\" vwidth=\"191\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AL461VUmTRL4fRnmRlZU4fVUNQ2L7UNaoRGbL4Wko7MknN-0gihFp2hmCIa0L1h2MkyZU1hRol7ZnlCZUzUinzQkn7VkL8W7MmVRUN-PLzWFL8LsozNPL8WFLzCYLYb/v2veo4OeqtnjCsAbgDTJQty0LzG4okyPMmGbMkbw62T8c&oid=1201705132&ti